---
// Process.astro
---

<section class="process" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="process-top">
      <h2 class="process-headline reveal">
        SIMPLE<br/>PROCESS.
      </h2>
      <div class="process-sub reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <p>
          We've done this enough times to know exactly what works.
          <strong>Three steps. 90 days. You're in the top 3 or we didn't earn it.</strong>
          No mystery, no fluff — just a clear roadmap you can track week by week.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="process-steps">
      <div class="p-step reveal">
        <div class="p-num">01</div>
        <h3 class="p-name">We Dig In</h3>
        <p class="p-body">We audit your GBP, dissect your competitors, and map out exactly what it takes to own your market. You get a custom 90-day plan built around your specific situation — not a template we reuse.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-step reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="p-num">02</div>
        <h3 class="p-name">We Run It</h3>
        <p class="p-body">GBP optimization, review generation, citations, content, technical fixes — all of it, daily. You keep running your business. We make sure customers can find it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-step reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="p-num">03</div>
        <h3 class="p-name">You Watch the Climb</h3>
        <p class="p-body">Every week you get a ranking update showing exactly where you stand. No mystery. No "trust us." Just data. Watch your business move up in real time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
